{"ref":"BDB, שִׁרְיָה","hw":"שִׁרְיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁרְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> a weapon, perhaps <strong>lance, javelin</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:18\" href=\"/Job.41.18\">Jb 41:18</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרֶב</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִית</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסָּע</span>),—yet 𝔊 θώρακα, 𝔙 <em>thorax</em>, i.e. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁרְיוֹן</span>.","next":"BDB, שׁרה³","prev":"BDB, שׁרה²"}